          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "have a look",
            "ref": "v-have-a-look"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". You can also visit this bookshop in Canada."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Welcome to Otis & Clementine’s Books & Coffee. Ellen Helmke opened this bookshop in 2011. When you walk in, you’ll find something "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "unusual",
            "ref": "v-unusual"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Unusually cute, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "that is",
            "zh": "换言之"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Cats! And lots of them! Some are playing around. Some are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "napping",
            "ref": "v-nap"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " among the books. Some may even be reading Dr. Seuss’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Cat in the Hat"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These cats are from an animal "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rescue",
            "ref": "v-rescue"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " group. They are waiting to be adopted. “Sometimes people come in just to see the cats. Sometimes they don’t even know that there are cats here. It’s very cute,” said Helmke."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "People love Helmke’s bookshop. Cats get adopted and books get "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sold",
            "ref": "v-sell"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It’s a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "win-win",
            "zh": "双赢"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
